    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fill the fuel tank to 25% of its capacity. This level balances weight reduction with the need for engine lubrication. Record the fuel level in the audit log and attach a fuel gauge photo. Many packers and movers in Siliguri recommend this rule to avoid over‑loading and to meet railway safety guidelines.</p>
